WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.817
Local inference problems usually fall into a few categories.

00:00:03.817 --> 00:00:09.992
Out-of-memory errors suggest a smaller model, quantization, or shorter context;

00:00:09.992 --> 00:00:16.902
slow generation may indicate poor device placement; garbled chat can mean the wrong prompt format;

00:00:16.902 --> 00:00:23.377
and repetitive output often points back to prompts or decoding settings.

00:00:23.377 --> 00:00:30.207
When debugging, change one dimension at a time: model size, precision, device, context length, prompt format,

00:00:30.207 --> 00:00:32.956
or generation settings.
